---
description: Bevy 0.15 coding rules
globs: ["**/*.rs"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Always use Bevy Plugins, never put logic in main.rs
- Components are data only, Systems are functions
- No unwrap() in systems, use if let Ok()
- Use FixedUpdate for simulation ticks at 10hz, Update for rendering
- Query pattern: Query<(&A, &mut B)>, iterate with for loop
- Resources accessed via Res/ResMut, init with init_resource
- Bevy 0.15 API: use bevy::prelude::*, no more add_system
- Cargo check per crate: cargo check -p crate_name
- su_core must not import rendering
